      "title": "mein, dein, Ihr",
      "goal": "Say my and your with the right ending.",
      "tip": {
        "title": "Possessives work like ein",
        "body": "mein, dein and Ihr take the same endings as ein: mein Bruder, meine Schwester, mein Kind — and -e for plural: meine Eltern. Ask a friend with dein, someone formal with Ihr: Wie heißt Ihre Tochter?"
      },
      "phrases": [
